Applicant: (receive Invitation)
Applicant: Decide on proposed times
Applicant: Are proposed times acceptable?
No
Applicant: (send Request for alternative times)
Applicant: (receive New times)
Applicant: Select interview time
Applicant: (send Selected time)
Applicant: (receive Confirmation)
Applicant: (finish Interview scheduled)

Recruiter: (start Application received)
Recruiter: Review application
Recruiter: (send Invitation)
Recruiter: (receive Selected time)
Recruiter: Confirm interview
Recruiter: (send Confirmation)
Recruiter: (finish Interview confirmed)

Recruiter: (start Application received)
Recruiter: Review application
Recruiter: (send Invitation)
Recruiter: (receive Request for alternative times)
Recruiter: Prepare alternative times
Recruiter: (send New times)
Recruiter: (receive Selected time)
Recruiter: Confirm interview
